* Port order follows the two columns of the requested box.
.subckt RELAY_SPDT COM COIL_START NC NO COIL_END
+ params: RCOIL=720 LCOIL=0.2 IPICK=0.012 IDROP=0.010 TMECH=0.005 RON=0.05 ROFF=1000000
* Zero-volt source senses actual coil current without extra resistance.
Vcoil COIL_START winding 0
Lcoil winding copper {LCOIL}
Rcoil copper COIL_END {RCOIL}
* Current magnitude supports either coil polarity. The 5ms mechanical
* setting is approximated by a first-order armature response, not an
* exact reproduction of the Falstad mechanical solver.
Bmag drive 0 V=abs(I(Vcoil))
Rmech drive sense 1k
Cmech sense 0 {TMECH/1k}
SNO COM NO sense 0 CONTACT_NO
SNC COM NC 0 sense CONTACT_NC
.model CONTACT_NO SW(Ron={RON} Roff={ROFF} Vt={(IPICK+IDROP)/2} Vh={(IPICK-IDROP)/2})
.model CONTACT_NC SW(Ron={RON} Roff={ROFF} Vt={-(IPICK+IDROP)/2} Vh={(IPICK-IDROP)/2})
.ends RELAY_SPDT
